<p>Install the <code>ufw</code> <code>iptables-nft</code> wrapper with:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code># pacman -Sy ufw
</code></pre></div>

<p>Enable and start it with:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code># systemctl enable ufw
# systemctl start ufw
</code></pre></div>

<p>Configure it. By default, block all incoming connections and allow all
outgoing. This is what you typically want:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code># ufw default allow outgoing
# ufw default deny incoming
# ufw reload
</code></pre></div>

<p>Done!</p>